    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the rear right leg of a carousel pig. The saddle is brown and the tack is red with a brown clasp detail. The saddle blanket is green with a red border and yellow designs. The skin of the pig ranges from a light tan to a darker brown closer to the saddle blanket. The tail is also darker. The surface of the pig is well worn. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 16B right rear” at the top and “S.S. RALEIGH NC WAKE CO 8.5.81 JUL81D9” on the bottom.",
